  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Opinion on Business Partnership Programme Vietnam - C1634- phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to implement a partnership concerning manufacturing of biomass briquettes from waste bark, branches and roots of melaleuca, acacia, eucalyptus, etc. The purpose of the activities under the implementation phase is to enable the partner companies to establish a sustainable business cooperation and to use waste products to create jobs.

The expected result is to set up a briquetting facility and production line  in Vietnam. The Danish partner will conduct a high degree of technology transfer to Vietnamese partner. Community Social responsibility achievement is also expected result of project such as job creation, sustainable forest management environment protection, etc.

This grant covers the cost for further legal assistance from local lawyer to prepare the notice of crime along with the documentation  (C case 1634)</narrative>
  </description>
